&lt;p&gt;Work with various cross-functional teams to understand market dynamics, define pricing strategy, structure new platform deals, perform economic analyses, and collaborate on new markets expansion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leverage industry research, market report and other proprietary research to understand market sizing, merchant / consumer preferences and product market fit&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Draw insights from performance data, design and test new pricing constructs to optimize portfolio performance and economics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams on international market deals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
