&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building and operating cloud-native systems (AWS, Kubernetes) and using infrastructure-as-code practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on familiarity with containerized environments (Docker/Kubernetes) and CI/CD systems (e.g., Buildkite, Jenkins, GitHub Actions).&lt;/p&gt;
