&lt;h3&gt;Total rewards&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the people building honest financial products at Affirm should share in its success.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s why our total rewards are designed to support your health, growth, financial well-being,&lt;br&gt;and future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In service of our mission, we reward employees through a combination of base pay, equity (from&amp;nbsp;parent company), and comprehensive benefits&lt;/p&gt;
