&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a self-motivated and resourceful Bank Controller to join us during a pivotal moment of growth. As Affirm Bank is currently in its formation phase, we are actively building out our foundational team. Reporting to the Bank CFO, the Bank Controller will be central to this effort, playing a key role in the formation and operational build-out of the Bank.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Bank Controller will lead day to day operational duties of the Affirm Bank Accounting Team, including managing the G/L and daily operational flows, ensuring successful integration of our accounting systems and processes into Affirm’s systems and processes, and developing the regulatory function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Talent Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Build and lead the Bank accounting team, providing strategic direction, recruitment, and coaching as we establish the function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership: &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as a primary liaison with Affirm, Inc. cross-functional teams, ensuring effective service delivery under the Intercompany Program Agreement while maintaining the independent oversight necessary for a regulated banking entity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Reporting: &lt;/strong&gt;Oversee all monthly reporting to both internal and external stakeholders, including regulatory bodies, ensuring timely completion and submission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory Oversight: &lt;/strong&gt;Build a controlled regulatory reporting function to ensure the timely and accurate preparation of required filings (e.g., FFIEC 041 Call Reports, Part 363 Annual Reports, and Federal Reserve reporting).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with our external auditors to coordinate the completion of the annual Bank financial statement audit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Automation: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with our engineering and product teams to evaluate, improve, and implement various tools to drive accounting/reporting automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Analysis: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage other processes and functions, including financial analysis and projects as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
