&lt;li&gt;development and product experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The SRE team is seeking motivated software and systems engineers with the experience to build, iterate on, and expand incident lifecycle, reliability, and resilience practices throughout Affirms Engineering organization and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
