&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition to your compensation, our comprehensive benefits are designed to support you and the people who matter most. Benefits include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive paid time off, paid public holidays, and additional paid Away Days to rest and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive private healthcare through Lux Med&#39;s Platinum package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A MultiSport card to support your health and well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development programs to help you grow professionally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family healthcare support through Maven and parental leave support through Parentaly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental well-being support through Lyra, including up to 12 confidential counseling or coaching sessions each year for you and your household members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial well-being support through Northstar, with unlimited access to Certified Financial Advisors and planning tools at no cost to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups (ERGs) that foster connection and inclusion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility for creative tax benefits, subject to applicable law, role, and company policy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
