&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-Call Rotation&lt;/strong&gt; - There would be an on-call rotation for this role as a requirement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
