g on it by writing clear, easily understood, well tested and extensible code.&lt;br&gt;· You are comfortable navigating a large code base, debugging others&#39; code, and providing feedback to other engineers through code reviews.&lt;br&gt;· Your experience demonstrates that you take ownership of your growth, proactively seeking feedback from your team, your manager, and your stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;· You have strong verbal and written communication skills that support effective collaboration with our global engineering team.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
