 that is easily understood and used by others.&lt;br&gt;· You thrive in ambiguity, and are comfortable moving from low level language idioms all the way to the architecture of large systems to understand how they work.&lt;br&gt;· Your growth and impact trajectory demonstrates that you have mastered gathering and iterating on feedback from your engineering and cross-functional peers.&lt;br&gt;· You have strong verbal and written communication skills that support effective collaboration with our global engineering team.&lt;br&gt;· This position requires either equivalent practical experience or a Bachelor’s degree in a related field.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
